          "da_id": "TS3007c.C.dialog-act.dharshi.116",
          "meeting_id": "TS3007c",
          "text": "Well , we discussed it in a previous meeting , so I figured I'll just leave it at the L_C_D_ .",
          "participant": "MTD026UID",
          "role": "ID"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3007c.C.dialog-act.dharshi.117",
          "meeting_id": "TS3007c",
          "text": "And uh chip set ,",
          "participant": "MTD026UID",
          "role": "ID"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3007c.C.dialog-act.dharshi.118",
          "meeting_id": "TS3007c",
          "text": "well uh if we are going to use traditional buttons , we could go uh with a simple chip set .",
          "participant": "MTD026UID",
          "role": "ID"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3007c.C.dialog-act.dharshi.119",
          "meeting_id": "TS3007c",
          "text": "But uh if we decide to go on a n uh um L_C_D_ screen , we would use an uh <disfmarker> we have to use an a advanced chip set .",
          "participant": "MTD026UID",
          "role": "ID"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3007c.C.dialog-act.dharshi.120",
          "meeting_id": "TS3007c",
          "text": "And that would bring uh the necessary costs with with it .",
          "participant": "MTD026UID",
          "role": "ID"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3007c.C.dialog-act.dharshi.121",
          "meeting_id": "TS3007c",
          "text": "So that's something we th have to keep in mind .",
          "participant": "MTD026UID",
          "role": "ID"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3007c.C.dialog-act.dharshi.122",
          "meeting_id": "TS3007c",
          "text": "If it isn't uh manageable uh budget-wise , we'd have to go over to uh to sim to simple buttons .",
          "participant": "MTD026UID",
          "role": "ID"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3007c.C.dialog-act.dharshi.115",
          "participant": "MTD026UID",
          "role": "ID",
          "text": "Uh traditional uh or a touch screen ."
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3007c.D.dialog-act.dharshi.48",
          "participant": "MTD028ME",
          "role": "ME",
          "text": "Well , I think uh we're going to sell tell <disfmarker> ten millions of them ."
